    {
      "name": "Oldenborn Heritage: Lumenwrought",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "art/bbttcc/asli-icons/oldenborn_earthbound.webp",
      "system": {
        "category": "heritage",
        "source": "Bad Eden (2024 rules)",
        "tags": [],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Oldenborn Heritage.</strong> The branch that lit up from inside. Festival-spirit, glamour-spirit, the ancestor that taught the people to call something beautiful before they had a word for sacred.</p><p><em>“The world remembered old names. You answered—and you were lit by the answering.”</em></p><p><strong>Lumenwrought.</strong> You are the place-soul that learned to wear a mask of light. Folks call you elf, sylph, faerie, depending on what scares them prettier than it scares them honestly. You are the first reason a candle is holy.</p><h3>Traits</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Fey).</p></li><li><p><strong>Size.</strong> Medium.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lineage Lean.</strong> Your lineage leans toward <strong>PRE (Presence)</strong>—expressed primarily through Tier powers.</p></li><li><p><strong>Glamourcast.</strong> You can shed dim light in a 1 square radius at will, and snuff it out the same way. Your light is the colour of one specific moment in your past—the GM and you decide which.</p></li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
